%F A046169 G.f.: x^9 / Product_{k=2^9-10..2^9-1} (1-k*x). - _Sean A. Irvine_, Apr 07 2021
%F A046169 From _Elmo R. Oliveira_, Sep 30 2026: (Start)
%F A046169 E.g.f.: exp(502*x) * (exp(x) - 1)^9 / 9!.
%F A046169 a(n) = (1/9!) * (511^n - 9*510^n + 36*509^n - 84*508^n + 126*507^n - 126*506^n + 84*505^n - 36*504^n + 9*503^n - 502^n). (End)
%t A046169 A046169[n_] := Total[{-1, 9, -36, 84, -126, 126, -84, 36, -9, 1}*Range[502, 511]^n]/9!;
